                "text": "Veterans, their kids, their spouses, and survivors are all at risk of losing food assistance under Trump\u2019s Big Ugly Bill. This isn\u2019t how you thank someone for their service. \n\nCutting SNAP and healthcare is a betrayal, not a policy.",
