                "reply_count": 46,
                "retweet_count": 29,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "60 years ago, President Lyndon B. Johnson signed Medicare and Medicaid into law, transforming health care in America. \n\nIn Mississippi, Medicaid covers 667,000 people, including half of all children and 60% of births. \n\nIn MS-02, 1 in 4 residents rely on Medicare, the highest rate in the state.",
