                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 13,
                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Trump\u2019s \u201cBig, Ugly Law,\u201d signed on July 4, 2025, slashes more than $880 billion from Medicaid over 10 years. That\u2019s not beautiful, it\u2019s cruel. The damage won\u2019t be felt equally; rural communities in poorer states like Mississippi will feel it the most.\n\nI recently heard from a constituent who can\u2019t afford a doctor\u2019s visit, can barely eat, and has just $10,000 to last the rest of her life. She\u2019s not alone. Medicare and Medicaid are essential programs, and I will fight to protect them.\n\nIf you are starting to feel the impacts of this law, please share your story by visiting my website: https://t.co/ihcEik1Iss",
                "text_lang": "en",
