                "text": "Republicans don\u2019t care about fixing health care, even when they can see how it will affect thousands of people.\n\nA 54-year-old woman who runs a small business in Mississippi could pay $622 more each month for her health insurance starting January 1, 2026. That\u2019s $7,746 more a year she will be forced to pay.\n\nMany Mississippians will feel this burden if Republicans don\u2019t extend the Democratic tax credits that make health care affordable.",
